re AWS Storage Gateway is available, please visit the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/about-aws/global-infrastructure/regional-product-services/\" target\u003d\"_blank\"\u003eAWS Region table\u003c/a\u003e.\u003cbr /\u003e\n\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n","nosnippet":"0","headlineUrl":"/about-aws/whats-new/2024/10/aws-storage-gateway-asia-pacific-malaysia-region/","postDateTime":"2024-10-25T10:00:00-07:00","headline":"AWS Storage Gateway is now available in AWS Asia Pacific (Malaysia) Region"}},"tags":[{"id":"whats-new-v2#year#2024","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#year","name":"2024","description":"year#2024","dateCreated":"2024-01-02T21:28:59+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-09-17T18:03:36+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#marketing-marchitecture#storage","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#marketing-marchitecture","name":"storage","description":"marketing:marchitecture/storage","dateCreated":"2023-11-07T20:59:48+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-07T20:59:48+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#aws-storage-gateway","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#general-products","name":"aws-storage-gateway","description":"general:products/aws-storage-gateway","dateCreated":"2023-11-09T13:52:51+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-11-09T13:52:51+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"whats-new-v2#about-aws-whats-new-2024-04-aws-storage-gateway-canada-west-calgary-region","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"whats-new-v2","name":"/about-aws/whats-new/2024/04/aws-storage-gateway-canada-west-calgary-region/","dateCreated":"2024-04-18T20:07:01+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-07-25T14:48:11+0000","additionalFields":{"postBody":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/storagegateway/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eAWS Storage Gateway\u003c/a\u003e expands availability to the AWS Canada West (Calgary) Region enabling customers to deploy and manage hybrid cloud storage for their on-premises workloads.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eAWS Storage Gateway is a hybrid cloud storage service that provides on-premises applications access to virtually unlimited storage in the cloud. You can use AWS Storage Gateway for backing up and archiving data to AWS, providing on-premises file shares backed by cloud storage, and providing on-premises applications low latency access to data in the cloud.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eVisit the AWS Storage Gateway \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/storagegateway/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eproduct page\u003c/a\u003e to learn more. Access the AWS Storage Gateway \u003ca href\u003d\"https://console.aws.amazon.com/storagegateway/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003econsole\u003c/a\u003e to get started. To see all the Regions where AWS Storage Gateway is available, please visit the \u003ca href\u003d\"https://aws.amazon.com/about-aws/global-infrastructure/regional-product-services/\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eAWS Region table\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","modifiedDate":"2024-04-18T20:06:46Z","headlineUrl":"/about-aws/whats-new/2024/04/aws-storage-gateway-canada-west-calgary-region/","postDateTime":"2024-04-18T07:00:00Z","contentType":"Launch Announcement","headline":"AWS Storage Gateway is now available in AWS Canada West (Calgary) Region","postSummary":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href\u003d\"/content/aws.amazon.com/live/en_US/storagegateway.html\" target\u003d\"_blank\" rel\u003d\"noopener\"\u003eAWS Storage Gateway\u003c/a\u003e expands availability to the AWS Canada West (Calgary) Region enabling customers to deploy and manage hybrid cloud storage for their on-premises workloads.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n"}},"tags":[{"id":"whats-new-v2#year#2024","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new-v2#year","name":"2024","description":"year#2024","dateCreated":"2024-01-02T21:28:59+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-01-02T21:28:59+0000"},{"id":"whats-new-v2#general-products#aws-storage-gateway","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"whats-new